Jurassic World is a custom world sold on the [[Marketplace]] that lets one run the Jurassic World park by solving disasters and collecting amber and DNA to add new dinosaurs to the park. It also includes 21 skins from Jurassic Park and Jurassic World.

{{quote|Welcome to Jurassic World, the only luxury resort to feature dinosaurs! Craft and train dinosaurs, build exhibits, manage the park, and open it for business. Use vehicles and your team of NPCs to solve disasters or go on expeditions to find dino DNA. See how long you can keep the park open for a high score! Includes 21 popular skins and 60+ dinosaurs and hybrids.|The pack's description on the [[Marketplace]]}}

